          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"about.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"About {{COACH_NAME}} — practical frameworks, daily rituals, and compassionate coaching.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#f7fafc;--panel:#ffffff;--muted:#6b7280;--accent:#0f766e;--glass:rgba(15,118,110,0.06);--radius:12px;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#0f172a}\\n    .container{max-width:1100px;margin:36px auto;padding:28px;}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#e6fffa,#ccfbf1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}\\n    nav a{color:#0f172a;text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;align-items:center;margin-top:28px}\\n    .card{background:var(--panel);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(12,15,20,0.06)}\\n    h1{margin:0;font-size:28px;line-height:1.05}\\n    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:12px 0 0}\\n    .meta{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .pill{background:var(--glass);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent)}\\n    .avatar{width:100%;height:260px;border-radius:10px;background:#f1f5f9;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\\n    .section{margin-top:20px}\\n    .grid-2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\\n    ul.habits{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}\\n    ul.habits li{padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #eef2f7;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:14px;padding:10px 16px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    footer{margin-top:34px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    .faq dt{font-weight:700;margin-top:12px}\\n    .faq dd{margin:6px 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\">W</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h1>A gentle science for lasting balance</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">I combine practical frameworks and soulful presence to guide people toward sustainable wellness without extremes. My approach centers on measurable progress and tiny daily practices that compound into transformation.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Lead: Free Mini Diagnostic</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">Avg cohort size: 12 • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"section\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">How I assess where you are</h3>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--muted)\\\">My intake blends a structured diagnostic with reflective prompts so we map strengths, friction points, and meaningful goals. The outcome is a clear, phase-based plan you can follow with confidence.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"section grid-2\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Frameworks I use</h4>\\n            <ul style=\\\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n              <li>Foundations first: sleep, movement, baseline nutrition</li>\\n              <li>Ritual design for momentum</li>\\n              <li>Reflective tracking + small experiments</li>\\n            </ul>\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">What to expect</h4>\\n            <p style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Clear commitments, weekly checkpoints, and micro-habits tailored to your rhythm — with compassionate accountability.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"card avatar\\\">\\n        <!-- referenced asset for page identity -->\\n        <img src=\\\"assets/img/avatar.svg\\\" alt=\\\"{{COACH_NAME}} avatar\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px\\\" />\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section card\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Tiny habits, measurable shifts</h3>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">I design micro-habit prescriptions that slot into your existing life. These are not generic checklists — they are precise, testable, and personalized.</p>\\n      <ul class=\\\"habits\\\">\\n        <li>2-minute morning grounding</li>\\n        <li>Daily energy audit (60s)</li>\\n        <li>Micro movement 3x/day</li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section card\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Investment: tailored pathways</h3>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--muted)\\\">I run both intimate cohorts and bespoke 1:1 guidance. Cohorts emphasize peer learning and structure; private coaching is for rapid, individualized progress.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #eef2f7\\\">\\n          <strong>Starter Cohort</strong>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">8 weeks • Group intake • Weekly labs</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #eef2f7\\\">\\n          <strong>Private Path</strong>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">Custom pacing • 1:1 coaching • Deep diagnostics</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Explore cohorts</a>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section card\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">FAQs</h3>\\n      <dl class=\\\"faq\\\">\\n        <dt>How does the diagnostic work?</dt>\\n        <dd>I share a short intake + a 10-minute welcome call. Together we translate results into a phase plan you can track week-to-week.</dd>\\n        <dt>Is this spiritual coaching?</dt>\\n        <dd>Yes — my voice is grounded in presence practices and reflection. I blend those with pragmatic habit design; no dogma, only useful practices.</dd>\\n      </dl>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>Questions? Call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> or email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"services.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Services — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Offerings from {{COACH_NAME}} — assessments, workshops, and tailored programs for sustainable wellness.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#ffffff;--panel:#f8fafc;--muted:#475569;--accent:#056b6f;--radius:10px;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial}\\n    body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#0b1220}\\n    .wrap{max-width:1050px;margin:32px auto;padding:22px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    .nav a{margin-left:16px;color:#0b1220;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    .hero{display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;margin-top:20px}\\n    .hero .left{flex:1}\\n    .hero .right{width:320px}\\n    .card{background:var(--panel);padding:20px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(9,10,12,0.04)}\\n    h1{margin:0;font-size:26px}\\n    p{color:var(--muted)}\\n    .offer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:16px}\\n    .offer{padding:16px;border-radius:10px;background:white;border:1px solid #eef2f6}\\n    .price{font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);margin-top:8px}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    .diag{margin-top:18px;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #eef2f6}\\n    .micro{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px}\\n    .micro div{flex:1;background:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;border:1px solid #eef2f6}\\n    .faq{margin-top:18px}\\n    .faq h4{margin:0 0 8px}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav class=\\\"nav\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Who I Am</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Programs</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"left card\\\">\\n        <h1>Targeted services for real-world routines</h1>\\n        <p>Each offering is built to produce small wins that stack. Whether you want a focused reset or an ongoing cohort, you'll get a concise roadmap and clear, testable steps.</p>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"diag\\\">\\n          <strong>Quick Diagnostic</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Start with my 7-question intake — free. It surfaces your primary levers and gives a simple next-step plan.</p>\\n          <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Start the diagnostic</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"right card\\\">\\n        <img src=\\\"assets/img/hero.svg\\\" alt=\\\"illustration\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;height:200px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px\\\" />\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <strong>{{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</strong>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">Located in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • Virtual cohorts worldwide</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Core offerings</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"offer-grid\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"offer\\\">\\n          <strong>1:1 Precision Path</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"price\\\">Custom plan • By conversation</div>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Six-week blocks, weekly sessions, habit engineering and progress review.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"offer\\\">\\n          <strong>Deep Reset Workshop</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"price\\\">Weekend • Group format</div>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">An intensive practice lab to remove friction and restart routines with clarity.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"offer\\\">\\n          <strong>Micro Habit Labs</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"price\\\">Ongoing • Subscription</div>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Weekly prompts and community accountability for gradual, cumulative change.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Micro practices I prescribe</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"micro\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <strong>Evening Reset</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0\\\">A 4-minute ritual to debrief your day and prime tomorrow.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <strong>Energy Checks</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0\\\">A 1-minute pause to reallocate focus before a task.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <strong>Mini Movement</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0\\\">Small bursts scheduled to prevent energy dips.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Packages & investment framing</h2>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--muted)\\\">I frame pricing as an investment in capability: foundational work (short-term), momentum (mid-term), integration (sustained). Payment options available.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:white;border:1px solid #eef2f6\\\">\\n          <strong>Foundational</strong>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">4 weeks • Clear starter plan</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:white;border:1px solid #eef2f6\\\">\\n          <strong>Momentum</strong>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">8–12 weeks • Habit stacking</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:white;border:1px solid #eef2f6\\\">\\n          <strong>Integration</strong>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Quarterly support • Deep practice</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book a consult</a>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"card faq\\\">\\n      <h4>Commonly asked</h4>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\"><strong>Who benefits most?</strong> People ready to test small changes and track outcomes — the curious and committed.</p>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\"><strong>Do you take insurance?</strong> No. Our work is skill and habit-based coaching, not medical treatment.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer style=\\\"margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Questions or group inquiries: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"programs.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Programs — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Cohort-based programs and pathways led by {{COACH_NAME}} — designed for sustained habit change.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#f3f6f8;--card:#fff;--muted:#334155;--accent:#0b6b66;--radius:14px;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto}\\n    body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#041123}\\n    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:24px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{margin-left:16px;color:#041123;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    .hero{display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:center;margin-top:20px}\\n    .hero .text{flex:1}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);padding:20px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 12px 36px rgba(8,10,12,0.06)}\\n    .tiers{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:16px}\\n    .tier{padding:14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #eef3f7}\\n    .tier h3{margin:0}\\n    .meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    .diagnostic{margin-top:18px;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff, #f8fafb)}\\n    .faq{margin-top:18px}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"text card\\\">\\n        <h1>Group cohorts: structured, supportive, time-bound</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"meta\\\">My cohorts are learning-focused group programs with shared curricula, weekly lessons, and peer accountability. They run on a cohort schedule to create momentum and community.</p>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"diagnostic\\\">\\n          <strong>Intake & mapping</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">All cohorts begin with a diagnostic map to locate priorities and personalize micro-habits within the group structure.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside style=\\\"width:320px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <img src=\\\"assets/img/pattern.svg\\\" alt=\\\"pattern\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;height:140px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:10px\\\" />\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><strong>{{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</strong><div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">Cohort facilitator</div></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Available cohorts</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"tiers\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"tier\\\">\\n          <h3>Foundations Cohort</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"meta\\\">6 weeks • Weekly lessons • Small group</div>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">For those establishing baseline routines and consistency. Emphasis on sleep, morning and evening rituals, and simple tracking.</p>\\n          <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Join next start</a>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"tier\\\">\\n          <h3>Momentum Cohort</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"meta\\\">8 weeks • Experiments • Peer labs</div>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">For people ready to accelerate changes through structured experiments and accountability checkpoints.</p>\\n          <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Reserve a seat</a>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"tier\\\">\\n          <h3>Integration Circle</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"meta\\\">12 weeks • Deep practice</div>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">A slower, deeper cohort focused on weaving habits into identity and sustaining change beyond the program.</p>\\n          <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Apply now</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Daily syllabus & micro-habits</h2>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Each week contains a compact syllabus: a theme, a daily micro-habit (2–5 minutes), a short reflective practice, and a group lab to test one small experiment.</p>\\n      <ul style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n        <li>Week theme • Practical lesson • 3 micro-habits</li>\\n        <li>Daily prompts delivered to your inbox</li>\\n        <li>Peer accountability and weekly check-ins</li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Tuition & value framing</h2>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Cohort pricing is offered per-person and framed around skill development and community outcomes. Scholarships and payment plans available so cost is not a barrier.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:#f8fafb;border:1px solid #e6eef0\\\">\\n          <strong>Per Cohort</strong>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Starts at $299 — includes materials and weekly support</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #eef2f6\\\">\\n          <strong>Membership</strong>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Ongoing access to labs and alumni circles</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"card faq\\\">\\n      <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Questions about cohorts</h4>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\"><strong>How many people per cohort?</strong> Typically 8–14 participants to keep the experience intimate.</p>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\"><strong>What if I miss a week?</strong> Lessons are asynchronous and recorded; labs are live — we encourage attendance but offer catch-up options.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer style=\\\"margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Ready to join? <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
        }
      ],
      "role": "assistant"
    }
